   {
    "kind": "text",
    "tag": "p",
    "html": "<span class=\"color_37 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Over half of MasterClass’s extensive portfolio of instructors are featured in this companion piece to the “Now You” brand campaign.&nbsp; The film was designed to showcase the depth and breadth of our instructor portfolio and get people thinking about the year to come with a sly nod to end-of-year countdowns and the growing excitement that a new year brings. The campaign launched just after Christmas with heavier media during New Year to capitalize on post-holiday sales and resolution setters.&nbsp;</span></span>",
